{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>The depths, etc.</b> According to what I explained (Exodus 14:21), that half of the sea was spread out and half was split, and each part is called תהום (depth) on account of the abundance of its waters, and both of them covered them. See also the verse ״קָפְאוּ תְהֹמֹת״ (Exodus 15:8) in another respect:" "<b>They went down into the depths.</b> It alludes to those who were striving to ascend from the sea by the power of the art of sorcery, which brought them down into the deep waters, as I explained in the verse (Exodus 14:27) ״וַיְנַעֵר״ etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:28:16.757965666Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}